// ***************
// Filename: vision_system_regs_if.sv
// Author: FPGA Cores 4 U
// Description: Register interface of vision_system: joins the register map
//   vision_system_regs (modport regs) and the logic vision_system (modport
//   core). cfg_* go from the register map to the logic (register values, _wr
